      </div>
      <div class="bp-feature-card">
        <h3>Conditional Access</h3>
        <p class="bp-feature-tag">Smart security policies</p>
        <p>Define rules for who can access what, from where, on which devices. For example:</p>
        <ul class="bp-check-list">
          <li>Block access from unmanaged devices</li>
          <li>Block logins from high-risk countries</li>
          <li>Require MFA for sensitive apps</li>
          <li>Only allow compliant devices</li>
          <li>Block risky sign-ins automatically</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="bp-feature-note bp-note-purple">Even stolen passwords won't get attackers in.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bp-feature-card">
        <h3>Intune Policies</h3>
        <p class="bp-feature-tag">Standardised configuration</p>
        <p>Push consistent settings to every device without touching them individually:</p>
        <ul class="bp-check-list">
          <li>WiFi passwords deployed silently</li>
          <li>BitLocker encryption enforced</li>
          <li>OneDrive Known Folder Move enabled</li>
          <li>Windows Defender configured</li>
          <li>Windows Updates managed</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="bp-feature-note bp-note-green">Every device meets your security baseline.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bp-feature-card">
        <h3>Defender for Business</h3>
        <p class="bp-feature-tag">Enterprise-grade protection</p>
        <p>Not just antivirus -a complete endpoint protection platform:</p>
        <ul class="bp-check-list">
          <li>Next-gen anti-malware</li>
          <li>Attack surface reduction</li>
          <li>Ransomware protection</li>
          <li>Web content filtering</li>
          <li>Centralised dashboard</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="bp-feature-note bp-note-red">Replaces Sophos, ESET, and similar -included in the license.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sa-section sa-deep">
    <div class="sa-wrap sa-center" style="--sa-max: 820px">
      <h2 class="bp-h2">Real-World Scenarios</h2>
      <p class="bp-body">These situations happen in SMBs every day. The difference between crisis and non-event is device enrollment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sa-wrap bp-accordion-list" style="--sa-max: 820px">
      {scenarios.map(scenario => (
        <details class="bp-accordion">
          <summary>
            <span>{scenario.title}</span>
            <span class="bp-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </summary>
          <div class="bp-accordion-body">
            <p class="bp-story">{scenario.story}</p>
            <div class="bp-scenario-grid">
              <div class="bp-scenario-bad">
                <h3>Without Device Enrollment</h3>
                <p>{scenario.withoutEnrollment}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="bp-scenario-good">
                <h3>With Device Enrollment</h3>
                <p>{scenario.withEnrollment}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="bp-lesson"><strong>Key Insight:</strong> {scenario.lesson}</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sa-section sa-paper">
    <div class="sa-wrap sa-center" style="--sa-max: 800px">
      <h2 class="bp-h2">See the Value Gap</h2>
      <p class="bp-body">The price difference between Standard and Premium is often less than what you're already paying for separate tools.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sa-wrap" style="--sa-max: 800px">
      <div class="bp-comparator">
        <div class="bp-comparator-head">
          <h3><span class="bp-icon bp-icon-refresh" aria-hidden="true"></span> License Upgrade Calculator</h3>
          <p>Select your current license to see the value gap.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bp-comparator-body">
          <div class="bp-plan-toggle" data-license-comparator>
            <button type="button" data-plan="basic" aria-pressed="false">Business Basic (£4.90)</button>
            <button type="button" data-plan="standard" aria-pressed="true">Business Standard (£10.30)</button>
          </div>
          <div class="bp-comparator-grid">
            <div class="bp-plan-col">
              <h4>Current Setup</h4>
              <div class="bp-plan-card">
                <div class="bp-plan-name" data-current-name>Microsoft 365 Standard</div>
                <div class="bp-plan-price" data-current-price>£10.30</div>
                <ul class="bp-plan-list">
                  <li class="bp-yes">Email &amp; Calendar</li>
                  <li class="bp-yes">Web/Mobile Apps</li>
                  <li class="bp-yes" data-desktop-apps>Desktop Apps (Word/Excel)</li>
                  <li class="bp-no">No Device Management (Intune)</li>
                  <li class="bp-no">No Advanced Phishing Protection</li>
                  <li class="bp-no">No Conditional Access (Geo-block)</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bp-plan-col bp-plan-col-highlight">
              <p class="bp-plan-flag">Recommended Upgrade</p>
              <h4>Business Premium</h4>
              <div class="bp-plan-card bp-plan-card-highlight">
                <div class="bp-plan-name">Business Premium</div>
                <div class="bp-plan-price">£18.10</div>
                <p class="bp-plan-gap" data-plan-gap>Difference: Only £7.80 / month</p>
                <ul class="bp-plan-list">
                  <li class="bp-yes"><strong>Everything</strong> in Standard</li>
                  <li class="bp-yes"><strong>Intune:</strong> Wipe lost laptops remotely</li>
                  <li class="bp-yes"><strong>Defender:</strong> Enterprise Antivirus included</li>
                  <li class="bp-yes"><strong>Azure P1:</strong> Block hackers by country</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="bp-plan-savings">
                  <p>To get these features separately with 3rd party tools would cost approx <strong>£15.00</strong> extra.</p>
                  <p class="bp-savings-line" data-plan-savings>Upgrading saves you approx £7.20 per user vs buying separate tools!</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="sa-center">
            <button type="button" class="sa-button" data-goto-contact>Upgrade My Licenses <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
            <p class="bp-fineprint">*Prices based on Microsoft UK RRP for Annual Commitment, paid monthly. Excludes VAT.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
